er: `ERR_FAIL_V_MSG(ERR_INVALID_DATA, \"Vertex array must be a PackedVector2Array`...\r\nRenderingServer: `ERR_FAIL_V_MSG(ERR_INVALID_DATA, \"Bones array must be a PackedInt32Array.\");`\r\n(last two are part of the same method, so there are essentially two different formatting's each with sample size one.)\r\nI kinda prefer the \"'p_name' array\" way from WebRTCMultiplayerPeer, ie. option 2.","created_at":"2026-06-04T12:49:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T12:49:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120004#discussion_r3356083405","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120004","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3356083405"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120004#discussion_r3356083405"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120004"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3356083405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":52,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3355610231,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3356088554","pull_request_review_id":4427929184,"id":3356088554,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7ICdjq","diff_hunk":"@@ -49,6 +49,7 @@ int64_t RandomPCG::rand_weighted(const Vector<float> &p_weights) {\n \tconst float *weights = p_weights.ptr();\n \tfloat weights_sum = 0.0;\n \tfor (int64_t i = 0; i < weights_size; ++i) {\n+\t\tERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(weights[i] < 0.0, -1, \"Weight array contains a negative value at index \" + itos(i) + \".\");","path":"core/math/random_pcg.cpp","commit_id":"3afbf2ba6eb99d1a3092e99f8a8b5bb21f546109","original_commit_id":"3afbf2ba6eb99d1a3092e99f8a8b5bb21f546